1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,477
For the next two weeks, the
office becomes a survival game.

2
00:00:04,527 --> 00:00:09,300
Food is scarce, everyone is hungry,
and anyone could turn on you.

3
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:12,500
The game runs for ten workdays.

4
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:15,984
Your goal: stay alive,
and on the last night,

5
00:00:16,034 --> 00:00:19,700
grab one of five seats
on the rescue helicopter.

6
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:22,702
Everyone starts with seven rations.

7
00:00:22,752 --> 00:00:24,560
Every night, you eat one.

8
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:28,500
Run out, and you become a
bandit. More on that later.

9
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:33,633
Each day, you pick one secret
move in Discord before midnight.

10
00:00:33,683 --> 00:00:36,192
Nobody else can see what you chose.

11
00:00:36,242 --> 00:00:37,800
You have five options.

12
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:42,509
Scavenge. Go looking for food and
find nothing, one or two rations.

13
00:00:42,559 --> 00:00:45,800
If you forget to play, you
scavenge automatically.

14
00:00:46,150 --> 00:00:49,698
Steal. Pick someone and
take two of their rations.

15
00:00:49,748 --> 00:00:51,857
They'll know they were robbed.

16
00:00:51,907 --> 00:00:53,800
They won't know it was you.

17
00:00:54,150 --> 00:00:57,620
Guard. You're protected
tonight and tomorrow night.

18
00:00:57,670 --> 00:01:01,692
Anyone who tries to rob you
gets caught, named in the news,

19
00:01:01,742 --> 00:01:03,418
and pays you two rations.

20
00:01:03,468 --> 00:01:06,800
You only get three guards,
so choose your moment.

21
00:01:07,150 --> 00:01:12,080
Investigate. Spy on one person and
find out what they did that night.

22
00:01:12,130 --> 00:01:16,700
Catch them stealing, and they're
exposed and pay you one ration.

23
00:01:17,150 --> 00:01:20,940
Gift. Give some of your
food to someone else.

24
00:01:20,990 --> 00:01:23,500
Only the two of you will know.

25
00:01:24,150 --> 00:01:29,874
Every morning at half past seven, the
news drops in Discord: who got robbed,

26
00:01:29,924 --> 00:01:32,913
who got caught, and who ran out of food.

27
00:01:32,963 --> 00:01:35,421
You'll always know what happened.

28
00:01:35,471 --> 00:01:37,700
You'll rarely know who did it.

29
00:01:38,150 --> 00:01:40,732
Run out of food and you're a bandit.

30
00:01:40,782 --> 00:01:46,800
Bandits can only steal, but get back to
three rations and you rejoin the survivors.

31
00:01:47,150 --> 00:01:51,122
You'll also get a secret goal
that only you know about.

32
00:01:51,172 --> 00:01:56,241
And once a day you can post an
anonymous message on the radio channel.

33
00:01:56,291 --> 00:01:58,800
Tips, accusations, lies. Your call.

34
00:01:59,150 --> 00:02:02,139
On the last night, the helicopter lands.

35
00:02:02,189 --> 00:02:05,861
The five survivors with
the most food get a seat.

36
00:02:05,911 --> 00:02:11,255
A seat and your secret goal both earn
points, and the most points wins.

37
00:02:11,305 --> 00:02:16,800
Then comes the big reveal: every theft
and every secret, out in the open.

38
00:02:17,150 --> 00:02:21,051
It takes two minutes a day,
it's completely optional,

39
00:02:21,101 --> 00:02:25,225
and nothing in the game touches
real work or real money.

40
00:02:25,275 --> 00:02:31,487
Type slash join in Discord and you'll get
a secret alias, so nobody knows who's who.

41
00:02:31,537 --> 00:02:33,500
And remember: trust no one.
